faijs — sheetmetal port
=======================

This package contains code ported from `brepjs-sheetmetal`
(https://github.com/OpenCascade/brepjs/tree/main/packages/brepjs-sheetmetal),
which is licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Ported as of brepjs commit 8685273a (locked upstream reference, O10; no
two-way sync). Ported source files retain their original Apache-2.0
attribution; only the import source lines were rewritten to the local
compat shim (D12). The faijs root package and `@faicad/faijs-core` are
licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

